                "Vitamin B3 (Niacin): Active as NAD⁺/NADP⁺; synthesized from Tryptophan (60 mg Trp = 1 mg Niacin).",
                "Niacin deficiency causes Pellagra characterized by the 4 Ds: Dermatitis (Casal's necklace), Diarrhea, Dementia, and Death.",
